  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">FR-14 is binding: hybrid semantic match → `confidenceScore` + `matchReasons[]` for fuzzy matter/project/invoice/org.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">FR-11 / owner override: rung 4 emits `Suggested`/`Ambiguous` ONLY — NEVER auto-files (auto-file is deterministic rungs 0–3 ≥0.85 only).</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-04">Engine/rung interface MUST NOT change to add a future channel — rung consumes the normalized envelope, never `Microsoft.Graph.Message`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-05">Rung 4 fires ONLY on deterministic miss/ambiguity; ADR-014 cache + ADR-016 budget enforced; expose telemetry hooks for task 032.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">Regarding targets per the catalog; org → `sprk_organization` (never `account`/OOB `organization`).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-013">Consume AI/search capability via the `Services/Ai/PublicContracts/` facade — do NOT inject AI-internal types directly into Communication code.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-010">Register any new rung service via `CommunicationModule` only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-032">If the rung is feature-gated, the unconditional engine consumes it via a Null-Object per ADR-032.</constraint>
    <constraint source="§11 Component Justification">Reuse `RecordSearchService`/`spaarke-records-index` — no new index/search client; answer the three-question template in the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="root §10 BFF Hygiene">Load `bff-extensions.md`; state Placement Justification; report publish-size delta (baseline ~49.63 MB incl. PDBs) + CVE scan; run `/conflict-check` before PR.</constraint>
  </constraints>

